# Procedural Modeling Commercial HDA

Reusable 4:5 commercial rebuilt from `assets/reffinal4-5.png` for Matthieu Huguet's Houdini shorts.

## Asset families

| Family | Instances | Parameters |
|---|---:|---|
| Text hierarchy | 7 | exact copy, size, spacing, color |
| Church image | 1 | position, scale, brightness, saturation |
| Diagonal panel | 1 | five measured polygon points |
| Brand assets | 5 | ZenRay plus four social SVG logos |
| Format geometry | 1 | 1080 × 1350 rendered at 3× |

## Build and render

```zsh
python3 Scripts/build_from_template.py
zsh Scripts/render.sh
```

Open `index.html` to tune the title, panel edge and church position. The controls never appear in the rendered PNG.

Edit `_params.json` to change content or defaults. Do not edit generated `index.html`; it is rebuilt from the template.
